  "problem": "Which of the following regions is connected?",
  "worked_solution": "A region $D$ is connected if every pair of points in $D$ can be joined by a smooth curve or a path in $D.$\n\nAmong the given options, the only one that satisfies this definition is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14163649/assets/4496057807b8ae67cf1c8687a1118e0cbcb797726c7ecff1029f34397f521cfb.png)",
